Author: Clark Chambers <clarkchambers94@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Jun 9 22:45:31 2026 -0500

    fix(aura): prevent permanent orphaned aura child skills
    
    Aura teardown was driven entirely by board-position bookkeeping with
    no authoritative list of affected units. Any desync (re-propagation,
    teardown ordering, save/load) stranded an AURA-sourced child skill on
    a unit with no way to remove it: AURA skills are removable only via
    their exact source, and children were serialized then restored with a
    stale parent uid after a game-over restart.
    
    - game.leave strips all aura children by the unit's own skill list,
      independent of board state
    - aura children no longer serialized; re-derived from the live board
      on load so source points at the current parent instance
    - old saves with baked-in children self-heal on restore
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

